# Project status

After a big feature, update `docs/STATUS.md` in the same change. A big feature is a new patient flow, API area, model set, admin workflow, or completed Stitch screen.

- Add a dated row to the big-features table.
- Refresh the "Now" summary and the area table.
- Record only checks that actually ran.

Do not update status for a small fix. Follow `AGENTS.md`.
